<title>USA: TABLE-Russell Corp Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Russell Corp Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDER CITY, Ala. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the 13 Weeks Ended:</p>
<p>					   7/6/97		  6/30/96</p>
<p> Net Sales			$270,273,000	   $290,558,000</p>
<p> Income before taxes	    13,219,000	     26,757,000</p>
<p> Income taxes			5,106,000	     10,447,000</p>
<p> Net income after taxes	  8,113,000	     16,310,000</p>
<p>Earnings per common and</p>
<p>   common equivalent share	    0.22		     0.42</p>
<p>Average number of common</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>   shares outstanding	   36,964,589	     38,630,930</p>
<p>					  For the 26 Weeks Ended:</p>
<p>					   7/6/97		  6/30/96</p>
<p> Net Sales			$528,432,000	   $548,412,000</p>
<p> Income before taxes	    31,550,000	     45,605,000</p>
<p> Income taxes		     12,134,000	     17,643,000</p>
<p> Net income after taxes	 19,416,000	     27,962,000</p>
<p>Earnings per common and</p>
<p>   common equivalent share	    0.52		     0.72</p>
<p>Average number of common</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>   shares outstanding	   37,477,032	     38,725,839</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
